        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#977DDF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6"/><line x1="8" x2="8" y1="2" y2="18"/><line x1="16" x2="16" y1="6" y2="22"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Mapa interactivo con tiempo real híbrido</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
        GPS del conductor cuando existe + estimación por horario cuando no. Buses en movimiento sobre el mapa con etiquetas de fuente: <span class="text-transit-state-success font-medium">Oficial/Comunidad</span>, <span class="text-transit-state-warning font-medium">Vivo/Estimado</span>.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="glass-card hover-lift p-6 reveal group hover:border-transit-accent/40 transition-all duration-300" data-delay="150">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-transit-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-transit-accent/20 transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#977DDF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="20" height="12" x="2" y="6" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/><line x1="6" x2="6.01" y1="12" y2="12"/><line x1="18" x2="18.01" y1="12" y2="12"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Lectura NFC de tarjeta del Consorcio</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Lee el saldo y últimos viajes de la tarjeta Mifare Classic del Consorcio de Transportes de Andalucía directamente desde el móvil, sin pasar por taquillas físicas.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="glass-card hover-lift p-6 reveal group hover:border-transit-accent/40 transition-all duration-300" data-delay="200">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-transit-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-transit-accent/20 transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#977DDF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Modo offline-first</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Descarga regiones completas y consulta paradas, rutas y horarios sin conexión. Mapas con flutter_map_tile_caching (FMTC). Cola offline con backoff exponencial para sincronizar al volver online.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="glass-card hover-lift p-6 reveal group hover:border-transit-accent/40 transition-all duration-300" data-delay="250">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-transit-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-transit-accent/20 transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#977DDF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Comunidad activa</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
