      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="glass-card hover-lift p-6 reveal group hover:border-transit-accent/40 transition-all duration-300" data-delay="300">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-transit-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-transit-accent/20 transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#977DDF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Accesibilidad WCAG 2.2 AA</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
        48dp touch targets, textScaler del SO, Semantics localizados en 3 idiomas, 8 matrices de daltonismo, OpenDyslexic, reduce-motion, alto contraste, RTL completo para árabe.
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="glass-card hover-lift p-6 reveal group hover:border-transit-accent/40 transition-all duration-300" data-delay="350">
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-transit-accent/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4 group-hover:bg-transit-accent/20 transition-colors">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#977DDF" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">Privacidad GDPR-compliant</h3>
      <p class="text-transit-text-mid text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Consent-gating real con revocación inmediata. Exportación de datos (JSON). Borrado con plazo de 30 días. RLS default-deny en PostgreSQL. Cifrado HiveAesCipher AES-256 para datos locales sensibles.
      </p>
